  "description": "Racing, Training, Triathlon, Criterium racing or simply getting fit? The Falco Elite has you covered. A race-ready Road bike with full Shimano 105 11-speed groupset and FSA finishing kit, without the price tag.\nThe wide gear and 50/34 Compact FSA crankset mixed with the wide gears (11-32T) mean the Reid Falco Elite is at home in the mountains.\nThe double-butted 6061 alloy frame with hydroformed tubing and internal cable routing is lightweight. Moreover, the Reid Falco Elite has a balance of vertical compliance and lateral stiffness for excellent on-road handling. The carbon fibre fork lowers weight and further reduces road buzz.\nThe Shimano 105 R7000 20-speed gearing is a solid performer that put simply, gets the job done. As Shimano trickles the technology down, the 4700 uses very similar technology to the higher level 105.",
